        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Trimco 1135630TG, Hygienic Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Hygienic germ free, hands free design 9 inch long door pull with 6 inch mounting centers. The 1135 Ultimate Grip Pull is made from solid stainless steel, it has a Trimgard Antimicrobial Satin Stainless Finish. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school and restaurant  doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHygienic hands free design - Door can be opened with the forearm.  Great for commercial restroom doors.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Trimco 1135630TG  Stainless Steel Hygienic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Special Ordered Item. <b>Final Sale</b></i>\r\n</p>",
